     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator target 1.1. 
b) Target number of new stations to be defined during Year2 of the project based on the network design
Target 1.2:
Enhanced modelling tools and technologies for the strategic flood risk assessment in DRB based on EUFD, including: 
a)	Spatial Data Initiative and data management system; 
d)	Numerical high-level basin-wide hydrological and hydraulic models of the DRB integrating detailed area-based modeling developed under AF, GIZ and national projects
Indicator target 3.1:
Two flood protection structural measure designed:(i) Reconstruction of the embankments along Bojana/Buna River on Montenegrin side and (ii) Regulation of the downstream Gracanica River in the Municipality of Niksic, using climate risk information and cost-benefit appraisal methods</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
